OL,3,GNEWSAPush for change in law to support
OL,4,Ayoung carers
OL,5,
OL,6,FCalls are growing for every school to
OL,7,Fhave a dedicated young carer lead - a
OL,8,Fmember of staff who can identify pupils
OL,9,Fcaring for family members and make sure
OL,10,Fthey get the support they need.
OL,12,FA petition calling for the role to
OL,13,Fbecome a legal requirement was started
OL,14,Fby Mid-Dorset and North Poole MP Vikki
OL,15,FSlade, working with MYTIME Young
OL,16,FCarers.
OL,18,FThe proposal would require the
OL,19,Fgovernment to introduce legislation
OL,20,Fmaking every school in England appoint
OL,21,Fa Young Carers Champion.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
